  "body": "<p>You can adjust the individual volume level of users in your server to optimize your audio. </p>\n<p>On the right-hand side, right-click on the user whose volume you wish to adjust and a menu will popup.</p>\n<p>A volume slider will appear in this menu, and you can lower or raise as you please!</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058735672\" alt=\"Capture49.jpg\"><br><br></p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">You can also make this volume adjustment inside a voice channel.</p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-center\"><img src=\"https://support.discord.com/hc/article_attachments/360058108972\" alt=\"Capture50.jpg\"></p>\n<p> </p>",
